        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-27T13:13:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;McBehrer&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"McBehrer\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think it SHOULD have a “you MAY” in there, so if you have to hit yourself or are hit by another hero you at least have the option of not hitting them back.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Really?! I think it’s hilarious and awesome that occasionally the heroes are forced to hit each other or themselves.</p>",
