        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-27T20:33:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Because they watch Family Guy? That… actually makes sense.</p>\n<p>Still, I think the best way is for the option to be there; Absolute Zero, for instance, would LOVE to get attacked by Ra or Wraith for fire damage.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, Wraith being infected, hitting herself, and then retaliating against herself is just plain stupid. And I mean wallbanger territory.</p>",
