        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-27T23:42:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another thing is to think of Wolverine, no matter who it is, if you sneak up on him he’ll react. I remember at least a few times in the shows where he nearly attacks one of the other X-men when they get too close when he’s in battle. And in one of them he actually does attack Rogue, luckily she had touched him and gotten his healing ability.</p>",
