        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-28T00:09:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>wraith is not wolverine by any means.   She’s not a fanatical machine of death.   She’s female-ninja-batman.    I’m sure she’s good enough with her fighting style to not just punch anybody in the face.  If you react and actually hurt someone that you didn’t mean to hurt,  then you’e just awful.</p>",
